# Gradle
#
# The build-output patterns are ANCHORED (leading `/`). A bare `build/` matches a directory
# of that name at *any* depth, and `dev.syndicate.build` is a real package in `build-logic` —
# so `build-logic/src/main/kotlin/dev/syndicate/build/` matched it and every guardrail task
# class was silently untracked. `git add -A` skips ignored files without a word and
# `git status` does not list them, so the repository built locally and failed on a clean
# clone with `Unresolved reference: dev`. It cost two sessions. See DISC-005.
#
# Anything added here that could also name a package must be anchored the same way.
# `.gradle/` stays unanchored: a leading dot cannot begin a package name, so it has no
# collision to worry about.
.gradle/
/build/
/*/build/
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.settings/
.classpath
.project

# Java
*.class
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# Python (blender-tool)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/

# Blender
*.blend1
*.blend2

# Runtime output — never committed. Fixtures and golden manifests under fixtures/ ARE.
assets/asset-index.json
syndicate.conf
*.log

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Blender module host writes a version directory next to the working directory
/4.2/

# Reference recordings fetched by game-client/tools/engine_reference.py. CC BY-NC analysis
# inputs — measured, never shipped, never committed (D15-R38a4, D15-R39).
game-client/tools/.reference-cache/
